# tests/pins/tinycc.sha256 -- sha256 of what the TinyCC route builds that
# live-bootstrap does not publish.  Not part of tests/pins/outputs.sha256
# because only CHECK_TINYCC=1 builds the junction files.
#   tinycc/tcc-first   build-out/tinycc/tcc-first, the first tcc, compiled by
#                      seed Forth (tinycc/build-first-tcc.sh, 790,384 bytes);
#                      the same in two checkouts at different paths
#   tinycc/junction/usr/bin/tcc-boot0
#                      build-out/tinycc/junction-root/usr/bin/tcc-boot0, what
#                      the first tcc makes of tcc.c in live-bootstrap's
#                      pass1.kaem (tests/tinycc/junction-check.sh).  MesCC's
#                      tcc-mes makes ea464b2f...; from boot1 on the two
#                      routes have the same bytes.
# When a change is meant to alter one, update its line in the same commit
# and say why.
7b2efd95a84f1d7c83369db586ffc113a8931c7c417b6d7854f7e577b42f4d97  tinycc/tcc-first
4e3e525a06ba9aac5b8095cf543e0840b2692a35b122682bedebc0c03effd06b  tinycc/junction/usr/bin/tcc-boot0
